{"_v":1,"id":"jekyll-and-hyde-2013","cs":43,"rc":16,"bd":{"positive":0,"mixed":4,"negative":12},"rv":[{"cn":"Mark Kennedy","o":"Associated Press","s":72,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"http://www.thenewstribune.com/2013/04/18/2563512/review-jekyll-hyde-overwrought.html","d":"2013-04-18","q":"It sometimes makes \"The Phantom of the Opera\" seem small and staid."},{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"http://www.newsday.com/entertainment/theater/jekyll-hyde-review-schlock-opera-1.5092189","d":"2013-04-18","q":"The score is mostly fourth-generation \"Les Miserables\" schlock opera."},{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"The New York Times","s":61,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"http://theater.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/theater/reviews/frank-wildhorns-jekyll-hyde-at-the-marquis-theater.html?ref=theater&amp;_r=0","d":"2013-04-18","q":"Unfortunately there’s no way to digitally airbrush away the hokum that pervades the whole show, like the ample stage smoke puffing away throughout the proceedings, giving a most commendable featured performance as the fabled pea-soupy London fog."},{"cn":"Frank Scheck","o":"The Hollywood Reporter","s":48,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/review/jekyll-hyde-theater-review-442232","d":"2013-04-18","q":"But for all the production’s excesses, it proves decidedly underwhelming, devoid of thrills or genuine emotion."},{"cn":"Jesse Green","o":"Vulture","s":38,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"http://www.vulture.com/2013/04/theater-reviews-jekyll-hyde.html","d":"2013-04-18","q":"Or, really, anything better than Orphans."},{"cn":"Elisabeth Vincentelli","o":"New York Post","s":25,"b":"Pan","t":1,"u":"http://www.nypost.com/p/entertainment/theater/run_hyde_from_ridiculous_revival_3GOJR6grnVV5az6dKylvHN?utm_medium=rss&utm_content=Theater","d":"2013-04-19","q":"But the drab revival of Frank Wildhorn’s show that opened last night mucks it up."},{"cn":"Adam Feldman","o":"Time Out New York","s":25,"b":"Pan","t":1,"u":"http://www.timeout.com/newyork/theater/jekyll-hyde","q":"Accenting Jekyll & Hyde’s best asset"},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":72,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.nydailynews.com/2013/04/18/jekyll-hyde-theater-review/","d":"2013-04-18","q":"Either way, “Jekyll & Hyde” is an over-the-top bloody hoot."},{"cn":"Elysa Gardner","o":"USA Today","s":50,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/2013/04/18/broadway-review-jekyll-and-hyde/2090599/","d":"2013-04-18","q":"Alas, a few glimpses of unfettered emotion cannot sustain a two-hour-plus parade of shrill melodrama."},{"cn":"Philip Boroff","o":"Bloomberg","s":45,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"http://www.bloomberg.com/news/2013-04-19/skinny-baldwin-pales-in-orphans-booming-hyde-stage.html","d":"2013-04-19","q":"With two of the show's catchier numbers (\"Someone Like You\" and \"A New Life\") Deborah Cox is a lovely, nuanced singer."},{"cn":"Erik Haagensen","o":"Backstage","s":38,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.backstage.com/review/ny-theater/broadway/jekyll-and-hyde-constantine-maroulis-deborah-cox-frank-wildhorn-leslie-bricusse-robert-louis-stevenson/","q":"Obviously, those were patrons unconcerned with being in the dramatic moment, and that is undoubtedly the audience for “Jekyll & Hyde.”"},{"cn":"Matt Windman","o":"amNewYork","s":25,"b":"Pan","t":2,"u":"http://www.amny.com/urbanite-1.812039/theater-review-jekyll-hyde-no-stars-1.5101232","q":"Calhoun makes many unfortunate choices, including over-stressing the score's rock elements and using both nauseating video graphics and violent sexual imagery."},{"cn":"Melissa Rose Bernardo","o":"Entertainment Weekly","s":25,"b":"Pan","t":2,"u":"http://www.ew.com/ew/article/0,,20364394_20692464,00.html","d":"2013-04-18","q":"It's good and well, not evil, but head-scratchingly, laughably, even painfully bad."},{"cn":"Robert Feldberg","o":"NorthJersey.com","s":25,"b":"Pan","t":2,"u":"https://www.northjersey.com/arts_entertainment/theater/203727731_Theater_review__Constantine_Maroulis_in__Jekyll_.html?page=all","q":"It's like being trapped at an audition for 'American Idol'."},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":25,"b":"Pan","t":2,"u":"https://www.talkinbroadway.com/world/JekyllHyde.html","d":"2013-04-19","q":"The show's problems are legion, and they start with the fact that it feels less like a musical than a concert featuring songs that happen to share a common theme."},{"cn":"Eric March","o":"Theater Life","s":30,"b":"Pan","t":3,"u":"https://theaterlife.com/jekyll-hyde-12/","d":"2013-04-23","q":"The new production does nothing to enhance the musical’s reputation."}],"au":{"score":62,"designation":"Disliking","sources":{"mz":{"s":62,"c":19,"sr":3.1},"ss":{"s":63,"c":9}}},"ta":"210 W 46th St, New York, NY 10036","pd":"2013-04-05","ca":[{"n":"Deborah Cox","r":"Lucy Harris"},{"n":"Constantine Maroulis","r":"Henry Jekyll"},{"n":"Laird Mackintosh","r":"John Utterson"},{"n":"Richard White","r":"Sir Danvers Carew"},{"n":"Teal Wicks","r":"Emma Carew"},{"n":"David Benoit","r":"The Bishop of Basingstoke"},{"n":"Jerry Christakos","r":"Bisset"},{"n":"Dana Costello","r":"Nellie"},{"n":"Wendy Fox","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Brian Gallagher","r":"Lord Savage"},{"n":"Sean Jenness","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Mel Johnson, Jr.","r":"Sir Archibald Proops, Q.C."},{"n":"James Judy","r":"Jekyll's Father"},{"n":"Ashley Loren","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Courtney Markowitz","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Aaron Ramey","r":"General Lord Glossop"},{"n":"Emmy Raver-Lampman","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Blair Ross","r":"Lady Beaconsfield"},{"n":"Doug Storm","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Jason Wooten","r":"Simon Stride"}]}